  "shape_rationale": "SAM2Base derives prompt encoder input2048, embedding128 and maskinput512 from image_size/backbone_stride16. SAM2Transforms derives resize2048 from model.image_size. Hiera official positional embedding interpolation and tiling supports expanded patch grid; FPN computes spatial shapes dynamically. Predictor hardcodes feature reshape sizes, requiring the listed runtime metadata override. TwoWayTransformer decoder operates on variable image token count. Memory attention unused by SAM2ImagePredictor.",
